{"body":"Can you add newly created benchmark data to zenodo, so we not loose it, document it, what do you need for this ?","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWd-swg","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Happy to archive the benchmark data. What I need from you: (1) a Zenodo API token (zenodo.org → Settings/Log in → Access tokens — scoped to 'deposit:actions') or ok to prepare everything for manual upload; (2) metadata preferences: title, description, license (e.g. CC-BY-4.0), and author list. I will prepare, per dataset, a package with PROVENANCE (origin, filters, preparation commands), md5 checksums, sizes, and a deposit-ready JSON, and document the exact upload steps in the repo. Ready now: the small 94 MB dataset (300 contigs). Later: medium 3,000-contig set, COMEBin demo inputs, and CAMI II marine sample-0 inputs — each packaged after its run. Sandbox (sandbox.zenodo.org) is recommended for a dry run first. Can you create the token, or prefer manual upload?","createdAt":"2026-09-23T20:56:23Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8#issuecomment-5802798274","viewerDidAuthor":true},{"id":"IC_kwDOUndL2c8AAAABWeAjgw","author":{"login":"paulzierep"},"authorAssociation":"OWNER","body":"Addendum: the preservation workflow is now committed in c65969a. `docs/10-data-preservation.md` documents the release scope, licensing/provenance prerequisites, and DOI verification; `scripts/make_release_manifest.py` streams SHA-256/size manifests. A local manifest for the 94 MB `comebin_small` set is staged and structurally verified (manifest SHA-256 `cb734384f7c069a8667d1a044ada3cb84d496321c9052e2212423e9a30fbf135`). No Zenodo upload is claimed; the token/manual-deposit approval and metadata choices from the previous comment are still required.","createdAt":"2026-09-23T20:58:34Z","includesCreatedEdit":true,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/paulzierep/metagenomic-binning-benchmark/issues/8#issuecomment-5802828675","viewerDidAuthor":true}],"number":8,"state":"OPEN","title":"Add benchmark data to zenodo","updatedAt":"2026-09-23T20:58:44Z"}
